    Brands and stores pay for people who plan stock well and read customers. They judge you by numbers, taste and follow-through.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is keeping a stock sheet that balances.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI and fashion business and merchandising careers: which tasks are under pressure</h2>

  <p>
    AI tools suggest trends and draft descriptions. Routine copy and trend summaries shrink.
  </p>
  <p>
    Taste, customer judgment and accountable decisions hold value. A staged path helps: now, use AI to explore and check; later, own ranges and brands.
  </p>

